<title>UK: Two Brent dates clocked, one kept, one deferred.</title>
<headline>Two Brent dates clocked, one kept, one deferred.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of the four Brent cargo dates nominated on Friday were left unclaimed at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>Chevron was left with a Jan 11-13 cargo and Cargill with a January 13-15 loader, traders said.</p>
<p>Earlier Esso kept its Janury 12-14 equity and Shell UK deferred its Jan 13-15 shipment.</p>
<p>--Richard Mably, London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
